<mxCell id="s1" value="1  BuildDataset (Processing)&lt;br&gt;Point-in-time join from the offline&lt;br&gt;store: 18 months, 41 M transactions.&lt;br&gt;Label = chargeback or confirmed&lt;br&gt;fraud within 90 days." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="110" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s2" value="2  ValidateData (Processing)&lt;br&gt;Schema, nulls, ranges, fraud rate&lt;br&gt;(0.1-0.3%), drift vs last training&lt;br&gt;set. Stops the run on failure." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="110" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3" value="3  Train (Training job)&lt;br&gt;XGBoost, managed Spot +&lt;br&gt;checkpoints. Out-of-time split:&lt;br&gt;train to M-3, validate M-2,&lt;br&gt;test on M-1." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="110" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s4" value="4  Evaluate (Processing)&lt;br&gt;Candidate and champion scored&lt;br&gt;on the same test month: recall&lt;br&gt;at 0.5% alert rate, PR-AUC,&lt;br&gt;per-segment results." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#01A88D;fillColor=#E6F6F3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="110" width="210" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
